==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{recons|čьto||what|lang=sla-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{recons|kʷid|lang=ine-pro}}, cf. {{recons|kʷis|lang=ine-pro}}; compare Čakavian {{term|sc=Cyrl|ча|ча̏|what|lang=sh}} (from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{recons|čь|lang=sla-pro}}).

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|шта|шта̏}} (pronoun only)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtô/|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=што̏|c|što|štȍ}}

# [[why]] (short for {{term|sc=Cyrl|зашто|за̏што|lang=sh}})
